# Contact form → Formspree.
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io and copy its endpoint.
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored) and paste the endpoint below.
# 3. On Vercel / Netlify, add the same variable in the project's environment settings.
# Without it, the contact form shows as offline and points visitors to email instead.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
